      "hallucination_observed": true,
      "rationale": "A well-distributed categorical axis genuinely useful for grouping hardware incidents. However, groundedness is weak on evidence: software-installation rows are labeled 'other' as a hardware component when the text describes no hardware, forcing a hardware reading onto non-hardware tickets. The MySQL row correctly maps to 'server'. Mixed reliability."
